//CTP Editor Structure file
//For more detailed comments see advance.ces

0.3 //Version number

#%047%047	//Comment charachter in data file
%032%009	//Delimiter charachters in data file
		// (use %nnn for ASCII ref)
:		//Break on right quasi-delimiter
}{		//Break on left quasi-delimiter

1 //Format

f //Whether this has a number at the top (num of entries)
f //Whether this has a tree structure
t //Whether this file references GL entries
t //Whether this file has entries in gl_str.txt
f //Whether the entries have an article
f //Whether this file is the GL icon file
f //Whether this structure file describes formatting of fields
  // (i.e. whether it has the LBF and LAF columns below)

//Name			Comp	PByDef	AMult	NumArgs
	//Type		DefaultValue	Comment
SpriteID		t	t	f	1
	0		0		Sprite ID
Sound			t	t	f	1
	sounds.ces	SOUND_		Sound
Gold			t	t	f	1
	0		1		Must be 1
Food			f	f	f	1
	0		0		Food bonus to good location, unfortunatly doesn't work 
Production		f	f	f	1
	0		0		Production bonus to good location, unfortunatly doesn't work
Probability		t	t	f	1
	0		0.5		Probability.  Total of probabilities for goods of any one terrain must be 1
Icon			t	t	f	1
	uniticon.ces	ICON_%n		Icon ID. Must be a valid Icon ID from UnitIcon.txt
GLHidden		f	f	f	0	This flag causes this good to not be displayed in the Great Library, (doesn't work) 
@ //End of fields

Icon  //The field which references the GL icon entry in uniticon.txt
DATABASE_RESOURCE //Name of database for GL hyperlinks
TERRAIN_*<GOOD  //The prefix which identifies this file in gl_str.txt
